{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","readme":"","modules":[{"kind":"javascript-module","path":"src/file-browser.ts","declarations":[{"kind":"class","description":"Folders and files, as in Google Drive, Dropbox or a CMS media library: a folder tree, breadcrumbs, search, sorting,\na list and a grid view, selection, a context menu, renaming and drag and drop. It is the interface over the app's\nstorage and never reads or writes files: every change is reported as an event, and the app updates `items`.\n\n`items` is a flat list of `{ id, name, parent, kind, size?, modified?, type?, thumbnail? }`; `parent` is a folder's id,\nempty for the root. For a large tree, `loadChildren(folder)` returns a folder's items the first time it opens; they\nare cached until `refresh()`. `folder` is the open folder, which the browser changes itself as the user navigates\n(`folder-change`).\n\nThe folder pane is a `c2-tree` of the folders; below `--c2-file-browser--narrow-width` it gives way, the breadcrumbs\ncarry the navigation, and an Up button opens the parent folder. The toolbar holds the breadcrumbs, a search field\n(the open folder, by name; `search=\"remote\"` fires `search` instead), a sort menu and a list/grid switch. In the list,\na column header sorts by it; folders always come first.\n\nSelection follows the desktop: a click selects one item, Ctrl/Cmd+click toggles one, Shift+click selects a range,\nCtrl/Cmd+A selects all, and in the list the check box toggles one. `value` holds the selected ids\n(`selection-change`, which does not bubble). A double-click or Enter opens a folder or fires `item-open` for a file.\n\n`actions` fills the context menu (right-click, the menu key or Shift+F10, or the ⋯ button of a row) and the selection\nbar; picking one fires `item-action`. An action with the id `rename` edits the name in place (also F2) and fires\n`item-rename`; `delete` is bound to the Delete key. Dragging items onto a folder, in the list, the grid or the tree,\nfires `item-move`; dropping files from the desktop fires `files-drop`.\n\nBoth views are a multi-selectable list box: the arrow keys move through the items (all four in the grid), Shift\nextends the selection, Ctrl/Cmd moves without selecting, Space toggles, Home and End jump to the ends, typing jumps\nto a name, and Backspace opens the parent folder. Each item is named by its name, kind, size and date.","name":"FileBrowser","cssProperties":[{"type":{"text":"length"},"description":"The browser's height.","name":"--c2-file-browser--height","default":"440px"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"name":"--c2-file-browser--border","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"radius"},"name":"--c2-file-browser--border-radius","default":"8px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser--background-color","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser--color","default":"#18181b"},{"type":{"text":"font-size"},"name":"--c2-file-browser--font-size","default":"14px"},{"type":{"text":"length"},"description":"Below this width the folder pane hides.","name":"--c2-file-browser--narrow-width","default":"560px"},{"type":{"text":"border"},"description":"Lines between the panes, the toolbar and the rows.","name":"--c2-file-browser__divider--border","default":"1px solid #e4e4e7"},{"type":{"text":"length"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__tree--width","default":"220px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__tree--background-color","default":"#fafafa"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Column headers, dates, sizes and kinds.","name":"--c2-file-browser__muted--color","default":"#52525b"},{"type":{"text":"length"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__row--height","default":"36px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__row__hover--background-color","default":"#f4f4f5"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__row__selected--background-color","default":"#edf1fe"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Check boxes, the focus mark and drop targets.","name":"--c2-file-browser__accent--color","default":"rgb(2, 101, 220)"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__check__checked--color","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":{"text":"outline"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__focus--outline","default":"2px solid rgba(2, 101, 220, 0.4)"},{"type":{"text":"length"},"description":"The narrowest a grid tile gets.","name":"--c2-file-browser__tile--min-width","default":"128px"},{"type":{"text":"radius"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__tile--border-radius","default":"8px"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__thumbnail--background-color","default":"#f4f4f5"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__selection-bar--background-color","default":"#27272a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__selection-bar--color","default":"#fafafa"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__folder--color","default":"#e0a526"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__pdf--color","default":"#dc2626"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__image--color","default":"#0d9488"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__video--color","default":"#db2777"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__audio--color","default":"#9333ea"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__archive--color","default":"#a16207"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__document--color","default":"#2563eb"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__spreadsheet--color","default":"#16a34a"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__presentation--color","default":"#ea580c"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__code--color","default":"#7c3aed"},{"type":{"text":"color"},"description":"Text and unknown files.","name":"--c2-file-browser__icon__file--color","default":"#71717a"}],"cssParts":[{"description":"The bar with the breadcrumbs, search, sort and view controls.","name":"toolbar"},{"description":"The folder pane.","name":"tree"},{"description":"The scrolling list or grid.","name":"content"},{"description":"Each item of the list or grid.","name":"item"},{"description":"The bar shown while items are selected.","name":"selection-bar"}],"slots":[{"description":"Replaces the empty-folder panel.","name":"empty"}],"members":[{"kind":"field","name":"items","type":{"text":"FileBrowserItem[]"},"default":"[]","description":"Every known folder and file, flat. JSON in markup.","attribute":"items"},{"kind":"field","name":"folder","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"The open folder's id; empty for the root.","attribute":"folder"},{"kind":"field","name":"rootLabel","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"The root folder's name. Defaults to the \"My files\" message.","attribute":"root-label"},{"kind":"field","name":"label","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"The browser's accessible name. Defaults to the \"Files\" message.","attribute":"label"},{"kind":"field","name":"view","type":{"text":"FileBrowserView"},"default":"'list'","description":"`list` (the default) or `grid`.","attribute":"view"},{"kind":"field","name":"sort","type":{"text":"FileBrowserSort"},"default":"'name'","description":"The column the items are sorted by. Folders always come first.","attribute":"sort"},{"kind":"field","name":"sortDirection","type":{"text":"FileBrowserSortDirection"},"default":"'asc'","description":"`asc` (the default) or `desc`.","attribute":"sort-direction"},{"kind":"field","name":"selection","type":{"text":"FileBrowserSelection"},"default":"'multiple'","description":"`multiple` (the default) or `single`.","attribute":"selection"},{"kind":"field","name":"value","type":{"text":"string[]"},"default":"[]","description":"The selected ids.","attribute":"value"},{"kind":"field","name":"actions","type":{"text":"FileBrowserAction[]"},"default":"[]","description":"The commands of the context menu and the selection bar. JSON in markup.","attribute":"actions"},{"kind":"field","name":"search","type":{"text":"'local' | 'remote'"},"default":"'local'","description":"`local` (the default) filters the open folder by name; `remote` fires `search` for the app to answer.","attribute":"search"},{"kind":"field","name":"loadChildren","type":{"text":"FileBrowserLoader | undefined"},"description":"Loads a folder's items the first time it opens."},{"kind":"field","name":"locale","type":{"text":"string"},"default":"''","description":"The locale for dates and sizes; the nearest `lang` when empty.","attribute":"locale"},{"kind":"field","name":"query","type":{"text":"string"},"privacy":"private","default":"''"},{"kind":"field","name":"cursor","type":{"text":"string"},"privacy":"private","default":"''"},{"kind":"field","name":"narrow","type":{"text":"boolean"},"privacy":"private","default":"false"},{"kind":"field","name":"loading","privacy":"private","default":"new Set<string>()"},{"kind":"field","name":"loaded","privacy":"private","default":"new Map<string, FileBrowserItem[]>()"},{"kind":"field","name":"expanded","type":{"text":"string[]"},"privacy":"private","default":"[]"},{"kind":"field","name":"renaming","type":{"text":"string"},"privacy":"private","default":"''"},{"kind":"field","name":"dropTarget","type":{"text":"string | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"menuPoint","type":{"text":"{ x: number; y: number } | null"},"privacy":"private","default":"null"},{"kind":"field","name":"announcement","type":{"text":"string"},"privacy":"private","default":"''"},{"kind":"field","name":"actionsMenu","type":{"text":"Menu | undefined"},"privacy":"private"},{"kind":"field","name":"probe","type":{"text":"HTMLElement | undefined"},"privacy":"private"},{"kind":"field","name":"menuPointElement","type":{"text":"HTMLElement | undefined"},"privacy":"private"},{"kind":"field","name":"internals","privacy":"private","readonly":true},{"kind":"field","name":"msg","privacy":"private","readonly":true,"default":"new L